{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MzdE1efuAHMBjG1FeiRk6s","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Miniflare scheduled trigger endpoint /cdn-cgi/handler/scheduled\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"docs.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://docs.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/miniflare/core/scheduled/\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/miniflare/core/scheduled/\"},{\"title\":\"codex-container-api-docs.previews.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://codex-container-api-docs.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/miniflare/core/scheduled/\"},{\"title\":\"docs-durable-objects-instance-replaced-errors.previews.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://docs-durable-objects-instance-replaced-errors.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/miniflare/core/scheduled/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"⏰ Scheduled Events\",\"url\":\"https://cloudflare-docs.justalittlebyte.ovh/workers/testing/miniflare/core/scheduled/\"},{\"title\":\"docs-durable-objects-instance-replaced-errors.previews.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://docs-durable-objects-instance-replaced-errors.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/handlers/scheduled/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"npmjs.com\",\"url\":\"https://npmjs.com/package/@miniflare/scheduler\"},{\"title\":\"scheduled triggers\",\"url\":\"https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/forge/remote/scheduled-triggers/\"},{\"title\":\"Now liveThe Skillselion MCP - thousands of ranked skills, loaded into your agent mid-task. No install.Get it →\",\"url\":\"https://skillselion.com/skills/secondsky/claude-skills/plugins/cloudflare-cron-triggers\"},{\"title\":\"blog.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://blog.cloudflare.com/author/aaron-lisman/rss\"}]\n\nThe search didn't confirm `/cdn-cgi/handler/scheduled` as a Miniflare endpoint. Miniflare's own docs document a different path, `/cdn-cgi/mf/scheduled`. The `/cdn-cgi/handler/scheduled` path shows up only in Cloudflare's general Workers handler docs.\n\n- **Miniflare's documented path:** Its docs describe sending an HTTP request to /cdn-cgi/mf/scheduled to fire scheduled events, with optional `time` and `cron` query parameters to simulate the event's values.\n- **Path in Cloudflare's Workers docs:** The scheduled handler page says that local development can test a `scheduled()` handler by sending an HTTP request to /cdn-cgi/handler/scheduled. It also says that adding ?format=json returns the structured result. This page doesn't say whether the path applies to Miniflare specifically.\n- **Programmatic alternative:** The Miniflare docs also describe calling `worker.scheduled(...)` on the object returned by `mf.getWorker()`, which accepts optional `scheduledTime` and `cron` values.\n\nIf you're on Miniflare, use `/cdn-cgi/mf/scheduled`. If you're on `wrangler dev` or another Cloudflare local runtime, `/cdn-cgi/handler/scheduled` may be the right path. I couldn't verify that from these results.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52961496-1bba-477c-872e-23c64e8e990c","uuid":"2ecd7c21-975c-4c5b-841f-3522848c53b5","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:13:35.133Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Miniflare scheduled trigger endpoint /cdn-cgi/handler/scheduled","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01AKcazcg37sj4FCNWPmokM5","content":[{"title":"docs.cloudflare.com","url":"https://docs.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/miniflare/core/scheduled/"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/miniflare/core/scheduled/"},{"title":"codex-container-api-docs.previews.developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://codex-container-api-docs.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/workers/testing/miniflare/core/scheduled/"},{"title":"docs-durable-objects-instance-replaced-errors.previews.developers.cl